  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DON&apos;T PUB DROPPED  The project will finance a program to implement a) the government&apos;s privatization strataegy and b) policy/regulatory reforms and capacity building investments based on recommendations from a body of value chain analysis developed in consultation with the private sector.  The value chain work would be based on enterprise surveys in the tourism, cotton, garments, pyrethrum, and processed foods industries.</narrative>
